SUMMARY:Trivia Night (21+)
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTest your knowledge and enjoy a fun night out at Trivia Night hosted weekly at Moontown Brewing Company in downtown Nashville! Gather your friends, grab a craft beer, and compete in five rounds of trivia covering everything from pop culture and history to music, movies, and more. Free to play and open to teams of any size, this lively weekly event is perfect for both serious trivia buffs and casual players looking for a fun midweek outing. Prizes are awarded to the top teams, and Moontown’s relaxed atmosphere, local brews, and great food make it an ideal spot to unwind and connect with friends in Brown County. Trivia takes place Wednesdays from 6–8 PM.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/trivia-night-21/
ORGANIZER;CN=Moontown Brewing Co.:MAILTO:
CATEGORIES:Food &amp; Drink,Happening,Tournaments &amp; Games
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/487956684_17848530876439622_2209094990935830433_n-e1747241033444.jpg
END:VEVENT
