SUMMARY:New Exhibitions at the Brown County Art Guild!
DESCRIPTION:July 24 – November 7, 2026\nGuild Artist Exhibition and Sale\n\nSummer brings fresh inspiration, and our Guild Artists have been busy creating new work to share. Discover new landscapes, still lifes, contemporary works, and more as you explore the Guild Galleries. Whether you’re an avid collector, art enthusiast, or simply looking for inspiration, this exhibition offers a wonderful opportunity to experience the creativity that continues to thrive in Brown County.\n\n\nJuly 24 – November 7, 2026\nThe Art of Brown County – Scenes & Views\nSpecial Exhibition & Sale\n\nThe Art of Brown County – Scenes & Views is a special exhibition and sale that celebrates the familiar vistas, treasured locations, and fresh perspectives that honor both the natural beauty and rich artistic heritage of the area.\nFind the places you love reflected in original works by the artists of the Brown County Art Guild. Every painting tells a story of Brown County & Nashville, Indiana with color, light and texture.\n —————————————————————————————–\nBrown County Art Guild – A not for profit organization located in the heart of downtown Nashville, Indiana.  On display throughout its galleries is a prized collection of historic paintings as well as current works for sale from regional award-winning member artists.  The Guild also offers artist demonstrations, workshops, and a variety of events or programs throughout the year.\nVisit our website: browncountyartguild.org or call 812-9088-6185 for more information   \nHours: March – December, Monday – Saturday 11am-5pm & Sundays 12-4pm\nWinter Hours: January & February, Thursday – Saturday 11am-5pm & Sundays 12-4pm\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/new-exhibitions-at-the-brown-county-art-guild/
ORGANIZER;CN=Brown County Art Guild:MAILTO:admin@bcartguild.org
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp; Exhibits,Free,Happening
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild, South Van Buren Street, Nashville, IN
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LqJMyRf_.jpg
END:VEVENT
