SUMMARY:Mossy Rock Pottery’s Plant Bingo is blooming with prizes, pints & fun! Join us the last Sunday of every month!
DESCRIPTION:🍀 Wanna Get Lucky at Plant Bingo?\nJoin Mossy Rock Pottery for an evening where bingo blooms a little greener! Instead of ordinary prizes, you’ll play 10 exciting rounds for the chance to win beautiful plants while enjoying the laid-back atmosphere of the Ferguson Beer Garden. Every guest receives a goodie bag, and cold beer is available for purchase to keep the good times flowing.\nWhether you’re a seasoned plant parent, a bingo enthusiast, or just looking for a unique night out with friends, Plant Bingo is the perfect mix of laughter, friendly competition, and leafy treasures. It’s a chance to relax, sip, cheer, and maybe even head home with your new favorite houseplant.\nJoin us the last Sunday of every month from 5:00–7:00 PM for just $25 and discover why everyone leaves with a smile (and maybe a plant or two!).\n🍀 It’s the most fun you can have in Nashville, Indiana on a Sunday night!\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/mossy-rock-potterys-plant-bingo-is-blooming-with-prizes-pints-fun-join-us-the-last-sunday-of-every-month/
ORGANIZER;CN=Mossy Rock Pottery:MAILTO:mossyrockpottery@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp; Exhibits,Family Friendly,Special Events,Tournaments &amp; Games
LOCATION:78 Franklin Street, Nashville, IN 47448
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-Sep-16-2026-11_18_37-AM.png
