TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Wine Your Way Through 2026
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us at Range 46 Wine Co. for a day of wine, live music, food and fall fun!\nWine your way through our five-acre corn maze as you search for six tasting stations, enjoying unlimited samples at each stop along the way. After completing the maze, stick around for live music, food trucks, fire pits, Range 46 wines and beer from Hog Molly Brewing Co.\nCorn Maze Tastings: 1–6 p.m.\nA ticket is required to participate. The corn maze is open only to guests ages 21 and older during the event.\nAfter-Party: 6–9 p.m.\nNo ticket is required.\nImportant Information:\n\nYou must be 21 or older to purchase a ticket and enter the corn maze.\nAttendees must carry two forms of identification at all times, such as a photo ID and credit card.\nYour photo ID and ticket will be checked before entering the maze.\nThe property grounds are family-friendly.\nWell-behaved pets are welcome but must remain leashed at all times. Owners are responsible for cleaning up after their pets.\nTickets are nonrefundable under all circumstances.\n\n\n
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/wine-your-way-through-2026-tickets-1996466673564
ORGANIZER;CN=Range 46 Wine Co.:MAILTO:range46wine@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Fall,Festivals,Plan Your Visit
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/image-1-1.webp
END:VEVENT
