SUMMARY:The Founder’s Exhibition, ﻿from Shulz to Greatbatch
DESCRIPTION:The Brown County Art Gallery’s curators are bringing together masterworks by the Gallery’s founding artists, sourced from private collections, for Showcase 2026: The Founders Exhibition — From Schulz to Greatbatch.\nThe exhibition will also feature a sweeping collection by Brown County artist Timothy Greatbatch, capturing Brown County as it appears today. Three years in the making, the collection will be available for purchase, with proceeds benefiting the Brown County Art Gallery Foundation.\n
