SUMMARY:Alleyween Party in Antique Alley
DESCRIPTION:ALLEYWEEN RETURNS THIS HALLOWEEN!\nLast year more than 500 kids joined us for one of the craziest, happiest nights we’ve ever had in Antique Alley. And we’re ready to do it again.\n🍬 Trick-or-Treating\n🎃 Costumes\n🎤 All-Ages Karaoke\n🐾 Costumed Dogs\n🎶 Music\n🍽️ Food & Drinks\n👻 Halloween Fun throughout Antique Alley\nSATURDAY, OCTOBER 31\n4:30–7:30 PM\nAntique Alley • Nashville, Indiana\nFREE • FAMILY-FRIENDLY • EVERYONE WELCOME\nSend this to your Halloween crew and we’ll see you in the Alley.\n
