SUMMARY:Tall Tale Tell-Off!
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to a room full of liars. WFHB’s Brown County Hour presents The Tall Tale Tell-Off, a signature event of our Fall Fund Drive. Featuring ten storytellers spinning yarns for a live audience – some true, some false, and some in between. Be there in person to vote for the winner! You will also hear story songs performed by four of our favorite local musicians. It’s a free event, just donate whatever you want at the door for the WFHB Fall Fund Drive.\n
