SUMMARY:Will Holiday’s Grand Ol’ Christmas Show
DESCRIPTION:Don’t touch that dial…this holiday season, America’s favorite Christmas tradition is hittin’ the road! Broadcasting live from the Grand Ol’ Radio Network on 1225 AM, N-O-E-L Radio, it’s Will Holiday’s Grand Ol’ Christmas Show! Step back in time with this raucous retro radio show for a night of incredible music, laughs, and Christmas spirit the whole family will love. Featuring all-time favorite festive Christmas classics like you’ve never heard them before and sketch comedy shenanigans that progressively and cleverly blur the lines between nostalgia and satire. Brought to you by The Grand Ol’ Production Company and a cast of the best artists and entertainers in Texas like Dalton Flake, Americana standout Blue Water Highway, and the Grand Ol’ Radio Orchestra and Gospel Singers! From Texas to Michigan, 18 cities, and twenty-two dazzling performances, November 20th through December 23rd. Find your show and get tickets now at Gochristmasshow.com!\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/will-holidays-grand-ol-christmas-show/
