SUMMARY:Harvest Festival
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Festival at Hard Truth Distilling Co.\nCelebrate the season at the Harvest Festival, a fall tradition filled with live entertainment, handcrafted experiences, and unforgettable flavors. Set against the backdrop of Brown County in autumn, this all-ages event brings together the best of the season for a day of fun, discovery, and community.\nEnjoy:\n\nDark Roast Rye Whiskey Release\nWhiskey Tastings\nLive Music Throughout the Day\nVendor Market Featuring Local Makers & Artisans\nCigar Lounge\nFall-Inspired Cocktails\nSeasonal Food & Beverage Offerings\nFamily-Friendly Fall Activities\nGames & Interactive Experiences\nScenic Autumn Views\n\nWhether you’re a whiskey enthusiast, music lover, cigar aficionado, or simply looking for a memorable fall outing with family and friends, Harvest Festival offers something for everyone. Spend the day exploring local vendors, enjoying great live music, sampling seasonal cocktails and whiskey, and celebrating everything that makes autumn in Brown County special.\nJoin us for a day filled with great whiskey, live entertainment, fall traditions, and the spirit of the harvest.\n
URL:https://www.sevenrooms.com/experiences/bigwoodshardtruthhills/harvest-festival-5031329906212864
