SUMMARY:Brown County Antique Machinery Show & Classic Car Cruise-In
DESCRIPTION:Brown County 4-H Fairgrounds Nashville, IN\nFree Admission & Parking\nOpening Ceremonies Daily @ 9\n$10 Membership Required for Exhibitors. Security provided during show. Entertainment. Kettle-cooked ham & Benas. Flea Market, crafts & Large swap meet area. Auction Saturday, September 30th at 2pm in include Playhouse, Split Rail Fence, and Lumber.\nDaily Demonstrations: Steam Engine, Saw Mill, Hit & Miss Engines, Bailer, Corn Grinding, Fence Rail Splitting, and Shingle Mill. Kids Activities Area, Barrel Rides & Pedal Tractor Pull.\nFor Information:\nCamping: Randy Barrett – (812) 325-6722\nVendor: Robert Smith – (812) 617-1614\nExhibits: Charles Meier – (812) 343-8489\nWorking Exhibits: Roger Daniel – (812) 876-3445\nSee Us on Facebook: Brown County Antique Machinery Association\n
