SUMMARY:Brown County Sports & TCG Expo 2
DESCRIPTION:\nWe Are Back!\n\n\nAfter an incredible first show, we’re excited to announce…\n\n\nBrown County Sports & TCG Expo 2 \n Sunday, October 11\n 9:00 AM – 4:00 PM\n Mike’s Music & Dance Barn\n2277 State Road 46 W, Nashville, IN 47448\n\n\nWhether you’re into sports cards, Pokémon, TCGs, memorabilia, comics, collectibles, toys, or more, this is the place to be!\n\n\n Vendors from across Indiana and surrounding states\n Buy • Sell • Trade\n Sealed products, singles, graded cards & collectibles\n Family-friendly atmosphere\n Food and refreshments available\n\n\nIf you missed our first expo, you won’t want to miss this one! Tag your friends, share this post, and help us spread the word!\n\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/brown-county-sports-tcg-expo-2/
