SUMMARY:Daughtry – 20 Years Unplugged Tour
DESCRIPTION:Formed in 2006, the Grammy Award®-nominated, multi-platinum rock band Daughtry has remained a dominant force for nearly two decades. Fronted by powerhouse vocalist Chris Daughtry, the band has sold more than 11 million records worldwide, earned four Grammy nominations, received American Music Awards, and achieved multiple Billboard chart-toppers, including three No. 1 rock singles. Entering a bold new chapter with their latest albums, Dearly Beloved and Shock to the System, Daughtry delivers a harder-edged, high-impact statement that reaffirms their evolution and staying power— proving they’re not just part of the rock conversation but are still driving it.\n
